# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of the checkout OS — a
# CRLF-corrupted .sh breaks bash on Linux (every line errors with
# "$'\r': command not found", and constructs like `done < <(...)` fail to
# parse entirely). Bit us running this agent inside a Linux Docker container
# after checking it out on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) — giip-fde-agent's
# docker/entrypoint.sh had the exact same class of bug (fixed the same way).
*.sh text eol=lf
